athenea-pieces (github.com/jesusluque/athenea-pieces), commits b26d276 and
35ae3cb, the parts of shaders/athenea/ the adapter needs, as written there:
- b26d276 "The sharp lobes read the sky at the roughness before the bake
  widened it": unwidened(), SplatSlope.bakeSpread, the sharp coat's and
  polish's roughness unwidened;
- 35ae3cb "The polish sees its ground, and a fold's coat is held to 0.3":
  SplatSurface.materialRoughness, kMaterialRoughnessMark / packPbr /
  pbrMaterialRoughness, kPolishFieldRoughness and the polish's field,
  kCoatFoldRoughness (applied by the adapter, as splat_project does).
Left out: farFaceReflected (kFlagOwnFresnel), which the pinned commit's
transmission does not pay for.

